  1-2. Affairs concerning re-examining pressure-resistant containers pursuant to Article 35-8 (1) of the Act (excluding the affairs of inspection to be conducted by a motor vehicle inspection agent);
  2. Inspection of motor vehicles pursuant to Article 43 of the Act [excluding inspections conducted by motor vehicle testing agents and designated maintenance business entities under Article 45 (1) of the Act (hereinafter referred to as "designated maintenance business entities") pursuant to Articles 44 and 45 of the Act];
  3. The designation of a designated maintenance business entities under Article 45 (1) of the Act, the modification of the designated matters under the main clause of Article 45 (2), the processing of a report on the modification under the proviso to Article 45 (2) and of a report on suspension or closure of the business under Article 45 (8);
  4. Deleted; <Mar. 14, 2025>
  4-2. Designation of a comprehensive inspection designated maintenance business entity (hereinafter referred to as a "comprehensive inspection designated maintenance business entity") pursuant to Article 45-2 (1) of the Act, changes to designated matters pursuant to the main clause of Article 45-2 (2), processing of modification reports pursuant to the proviso to Article 45-2 (2), and processing of suspension or closure reports pursuant to Article 45 (8) of the Act applied mutatis mutandis pursuant Article 45-2 (4);
  4-3. Recording and management of the status of cancellation or suspension of designation or suspension of business of designated maintenance business entities and comprehensive inspection designated maintenance business entities pursuant to Article 45-3 (1) of the Act, and cancellation or suspension of designated maintenance business entities or comprehensive inspection designated maintenance business entities pursuant to Article 45-3 (2);
