  7. Designation under Article 47 (2) of the Act of a specialized taximeter verification institution for the verification under subparagraph 6 among specialized taximeter verification institutions under Article 47 (2) of the Act, and revocation of verification and an order for suspension of business under Article 47 (5);
  7-2. Designation of a motorcycle designated maintenance business entity (referring to motorcycle designated maintenance business entity under Article 51-3 (3); hereinafter the same shall apply) pursuant to Article 51-3 (1) of the Act, modification of designated matters under the main clause of Article 51-3 (3), the processing of modification reports under the proviso of Article 51-3 (3), and the processing of suspension or closure reports under (8) of that Article;
  7-3. Recording and management of the status of cancellation designation or business suspension of motorcycle designated maintenance business entities under Article 51-4 (1) of the Act and comprehensive inspection designated maintenance business entities and cancellation or suspension of designated maintenance business entities or motorcycle designated maintenance business entities under Article 51-4 (2);
  7-4. Management of the current status of orders issued to motorcycle designated maintenance business entities for dismissal and suspension of duties under Article 51-5 (2) of the Act and of skilled technicians of motorcycles designated maintenance business entities under Article 51-4 (4);
  8. Approval for the use of electronic data prescribed in Article 69 of the Act (excluding cases where electronic data belonging to at least two Cities/Dos is to be offered simultaneously);
  8-2. Hearings concerning the authority delegated pursuant to the subparagraphs of Article 75 of the Act;
  9. Imposition and collection of an administrative fine prescribed in Article 84 of the Act (excluding the imposition and collection of an administrative fine on a person who violates an order, disposition, etc. by the Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport pursuant to Article 84 (1) 1 through 5, Article 84 (2) 2-2, 3, and 3-2, Article 84 (4) 13-3, 14, 15, and 15-2, and Article 84 (5) 3 and 8;
  10. Imposition and collection of penalty surcharge prescribed in Article 74 of the Act (limited to cases where the relevant authority is delegated under subparagraph 7).
  (2) The Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport and the Minister of Climate, Energy and Environment shall delegate authority over the following matters to the Mayor/Do Governor under Article 77 (2) of the Act. <Added on Mar. 27, 2009, Mar. 23, 2013, Mar. 14, 2025; Oct. 1, 2025>
